## 爱心使
"role.lovemesseger.ability.title" : "Unique Ability【Spread love】"
"role.lovemesseger.ability.main" : "Spread love to other players to get them to join the crewmate.<br>But when spreading love to %C% %N% %I% will die."
"role.lovemesseger.ability.crewmate" : "<var>Crewmate</var>"
"role.lovemesseger.ability.neutral" : "<var>Neutral</var>"
"role.lovemesseger.ability.impostor" : "<var>Impostor</var>"
"role.lovemesseger.ability.nocrewmate" : "<var></var>"
"role.lovemesseger.ability.noneutral" : "<var></var>"
"role.lovemesseger.ability.noimpostor" : "<var></var>"
"role.lovemesseger.ability.love" : "Use spread love let other players to join the crew team."
"role.lovemesseger.tips" : "· Lovemesseger use skills will grant them "kind" modifiers, which will must with the crew team to victory.<br>· If Skinner becomes kindness, then all the neutral will be get "kind" modifiers.<br>· If lovemesseger try to use skill to Skinner's, then lovemesseger die.<br>· Added by <b>十七号计划 Plan17</b>Mode"

