## 幸福小姐
"role.pollyanna.ability.title" : "Unique Ability【Will This Bring Happiness?】"
"role.pollyanna.ability.main" : "During both the action stage and the meeting stage, <br>you can exchange the appearance of other impostor and other player."
"role.pollyanna.ability.guess" : "· In the meeting, guess an impostor's role , then guess anothor player's.<br>It enables the first player and the second player to exchange their identities. And the latter will immediately die."
"role.pollyanna.ability.skill" : "· In action stage, use the skill on another impostor and kill one player in limited time.<br>It enables the first player and the second player to swap their identities. And the latter will immediately die.<br>· If the skill is not used on any  player, the exchange targets become yourself and the killed player."
"role.pollyanna.tips" : "· If Ms.Happiness possibly exists, player levels will be displayed as "???", <br>and all dead players show their costumes like when they are alive.<br>· Added by <b>十七号计划 Plan17</b>Mode"

## 新闻主持人
"role.newsAnchor.ability.title" : "Unique Ability【It's News Time Now】"
"role.newsAnchor.ability.main" : "The News-Anchor can select a player to act as an an Co-Anchor during the meeting. "
"role.newsAnchor.ability.skill" : "· At the meeting, by clicking on the corresponding player, that player can be made an Co-Anchor.<br>· When the news time is active, both Co-Anchor and News-Anchorrs can send news information using the "/news" command.<br>· The Co-Anchor cannot be selected outside the meeting.<br>· During the news time, all skills that require clicking nameplate will not be available."
"role.newsAnchor.ability.vote" : "· At the meeting, Click on the icon to open the voting panel and the panel for guessing the Co-Anchor.<br>· Guessing counts are shared. If other player's guess is not correct, that player will die.<br>· During the voting process, if the highest number of votes goes to a deceased player, nothing will happen.<br>· Roles that do not need to click nameplate, such as the mayor, activate their skills as usual."
"role.newsAnchor.tips" : "· Added by <b>十七号计划 Plan17</b>Mode"

